---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="French Riviera Tips | Privacy Policy | French Riviera" description="How French Riviera Tips collects, uses and protects your personal data.">
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:40px;max-width:760px;padding-bottom:40px">
    <nav style="font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);display:flex;gap:8px"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy policy</span></nav>
    <h1 style="font-weight:800;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin-top:20px">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--faint);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:20px">
      <p>French Riviera Tips ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what data we collect and how we use it.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> if you subscribe, we store the email address you provide, solely to send you our newsletter. You can unsubscribe at any time via the link in every email.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> we use privacy-respecting analytics to understand which guides are useful. This data is aggregated and does not identify you personally.</li>
        <li><strong>Affiliate partners:</strong> when you click an affiliate link, the partner (e.g. Stay22, Booking, Expedia, Travelpayouts) may set cookies under their own privacy policies.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under the GDPR you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by contacting us through this website, and we'll respond within 30 days.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
